WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.850
A base above one grows, and a base below one decays.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.775
With b equal to two, the graph doubles each step and climbs.

3
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:18.630
With b equal to one half, it halves each step and falls towards zero.

4
00:00:19.661 --> 00:00:22.036
It never reaches the x axis.
